codex
I found the concrete cause: this executor gives each command a PID-namespace-local PID while `/proc` is mounted from a different namespace, and Lean 4.22 resolves `/proc/<getpid()>/exe` (not `/proc/self/exe`). A compiled probe reproduces `ENOENT`. I’ll use a narrowly scoped preload shim that redirects only that executable-path read to `/proc/self/exe`, then preserve both the probe and shim source as audit evidence.
apply patch
